<title>USA: Sears names Shaffer as Western Auto chairman.</title>
<headline>Sears names Shaffer as Western Auto chairman.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co said Thursday it named Donald Shaffer as chairman and chief executive officer of its Western Auto Supply Co.</p>
<p>Shaffer, formerly president and chief executive officer of Sears Canada Inc, succeeds John Leach, who retired.</p>
<p>Western Auto operates 350 Western Auto company-owned stores, 900 Western Auto associate stores and 274 Parts America stores.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
